==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|вы́-|нести́}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|вы́нести}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-вынести.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|вы́нести|pf|impf=выноси́ть}}

# to [[carry out]], to [[take out]], to [[bring out]], to [[remove]]
# to [[transfer]]
# to [[get]], to [[acquire]]
# to [[submit]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''вы́нести''' [[вопро́с]] [[на]] [[обсужде́ние]]|'''to submit''' a question for discussion}}
# to [[pass]], to [[render]], to [[pronounce]] (a decision or a verdict)
# to [[endure]], to [[bear]], to [[stand]], to [[sustain]]
# {{lb|ru|slang}} to [[crack up]] {{gl|to make laugh}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[меня|Меня́]] '''вы́несло''' [[c]] [[э́того]] [[ви́део]].|This video '''cracked''' me '''up'''.}}

